  "title": "Sophie&#39;s Kolacky",
  "description": "This is my grandma&#39;s (Sophie) kolacky recipe, and it probably came from her grandmother in Poland. My family can&#39;t get enough of these at Christmas.",
  "authors": [
    "Peggy Malecki"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-04-21T10:28:45-04:00",
